---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import milton from "../../../../design/milton.png";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Milton — your vibes, in every assistant"
  description="Write down once how you like things done. Claude, ChatGPT and your coding agents follow it."
>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="headline">
    <img
      class="portrait"
      src={milton.src}
      width="112"
      height="112"
      alt="Milton holding his red stapler"
    />
    <h1 id="headline">Your vibes, in every assistant.</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Write down once how you like things done: how you write, how you decide,
      what never to do. Milton keeps it as a few short memos, and every
      assistant you connect reads them before it works for you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="details" aria-label="How Milton works">
    <article>
      <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">
        01
      </span>
      <h2>Write it once.</h2>
      <p>
        TPS Report for your working preferences, plus a memo for each thing you
        do your way, like how you write an email.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">
        02
      </span>
      <h2>Connect any assistant.</h2>
      <p>
        Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor and other MCP clients connect to one address:{" "}
        <code>https://mcp.meetmilton.com/mcp</code>.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">
        03
      </span>
      <h2>Keep every version.</h2>
      <p>
        Assistants can save what you tell them. Every change is kept, so nothing
        is lost.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="closing" aria-label="Early access">
    <p class="tagline">Vibe coding, but the vibes are in writing.</p>
    <p class="sign-in-note">
      Milton is in early access. Sign in with GitHub or Google.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 48px 0 72px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .portrait {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  h1 {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 6.5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .intro {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 40px 0 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .number {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 16px 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .details p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .closing {
    padding: 0 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tagline {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .sign-in-note {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 40px 0 48px;
    }
    .portrait {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .intro {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .details {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      padding: 32px 0;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .closing {
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .tagline {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
